For a positive integer $n$ it was shown in Ref.~\cite{yeh2022emptiness} that 
the  potential was systematically constructed  in the form of  series  
\begin{align}\label{eq:vnseries}
\mathcal{V}_n (\lambda,\bar{\lambda}) = \sum_{m=0}^{n-1} \frac{a_m F_m (\lambda)}{(\lambda-\bar\lambda)^{n+m}} +c.c. 
\end{align}
with the coefficients $a_m$ and functions $F_m(\lambda)$ obeying the following recurrence relations:
