\end{equation}
that we decompose in decoupled Bloch waves, where $U_K$ and $V_K$ have the periodicity $1/n_\mathrm{vort}$ we just discussed, and $K$ belongs to the first Brillouin zone
\begin{equation}
    -\frac{M}{\h}\frac{\Delta v}{2}\leq K \leq \frac{M}{\h}\frac{\Delta v}{2}\,.
\end{equation}

The resulting Bogoliubov equations at given $\Delta v$ and $K$ are
